-    0     0 ACCEPT     0    --  *      *       fd00:10:244::/48     ::/0                
-    0     0 ACCEPT     0    --  ovn-k8s-mp0 *       ::/0                 ::/0                
-    0     0 ACCEPT     0    --  *      ovn-k8s-mp0  ::/0                 ::/0          
